        406.69
      ],
      "text": "The undersigned is directed to say that the\nGroups of Ministers as shown in Annexure 'A' have\nrelinquished their respective offices with effect from\nthe forenoon of 14th January, 1980.\n\n2. Smt. Indira Gandhi has been sworn-in as the\n Prime Minister by the President at 10-45 A.M. today,\n 14th January, 1980, in the Rashtrapati Bhavan. Other\n Ministers sworn-in by the President at 10-45 A.M. today,\n 14th January, 1980 are shown at Annexure 'B'.\n\n3. Ministry of Home Affairs may kindly take\n such action as may be considered necessary regarding\n issue of Gazette notifications, etc."
    },
